# Build output. `bin\refl4619.exe` is reproducible from `refl4619.cpp` by
# running `build-refl4619.cmd`, and a committed binary would be both large and
# unverifiable. `run-refl4619.cmd` rebuilds it on demand, so a fresh clone
# needs no extra step.
bin/
bin-build.log
# Scratch containers written by the hand-run cases; regenerated by their
# generators. Committed evidence is the .txt transcripts, not the binaries.
scratch-*.dxil
